# ── Claude / AI tooling ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Ignore local Claude state, but keep the checked-in project instructions
# (CLAUDE.md) and the design guidelines it references. Note: `*.claude` also
# matches the `.claude` directory itself, so it must be re-included (`!.claude/`)
# before the per-file exceptions can take effect.
.claude.json
.claude.json.backup
*.claude
!.claude/
.claude/*
!.claude/CLAUDE.md
!.claude/frontend-design-SKILL.md

# ── OS / editor noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.vscode/settings.json
*.suo
*.user
.idea/

# ── Logs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ── Test coverage ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
coverage/

# ── Local tooling indexes ──
.codegraph/
